<span id="A3.SS1.tab1.1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Repetition Failure</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.SS1.tab1.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.SS1.tab1.1.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:139.1pt;">
<span id="A3.SS1.tab1.1.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">User was told to restate requirements but didn’t</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.SS1.tab1.1.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.SS1.tab1.1.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:119.2pt;">
<span id="A3.SS1.tab1.1.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Instruction says “repeat your budget constraint” but user doesn’t</span>
</span></td></tr>
