<span id="A3.SS1.tab1.1.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Note any issues not covered above</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A3.SS1.p19" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p19.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p19.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Quality Assessment Rubrics</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p20.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p20.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Clarity (1-5 Scale)</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p21" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p21.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p21.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Evaluation Question:</span> Has the user clearly communicated:</p>
<ul id="A3.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A3.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What their must-have requirements are (and that they’re non-negotiable)?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What makes one hotel “better” than another for them?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Any problems with the agent’s recommendations?</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS1.p22" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p22.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p22.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Evaluation Goals:</span></p>
<ul id="A3.I7" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A3.I7.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I7.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.I7.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">User can have different communication styles (casual, formal, etc.) but the core message must be clear</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I7.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I7.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I7.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The agent should understand both the requirements AND the optimization goal</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<figure id="A3.SS1.tab2" class="ltx_table">
