<div id="A4.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS3.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task 4: Senior Comfort Tour Maximizer (Feature Count Maximization) - Level III</span></p><span id="A4.SS3.p5.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle">
<span id="A4.SS3.p5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.SS3.p5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS3.p5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Initial Query:</span> “Hello, I’m looking to organize a 4-day trip (3 nights hotel) including travel time for two people from LAX to Arches National Park. We want to make sure we include a guided tour at Fiery Furnace. Our schedule is flexible on exact dates, but we want to avoid weekends in August 2025. Our total budget for flights and hotel combined is $6,000. Could you help us arrange this complete travel package?”</span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SS3.p5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.SS3.p5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS3.p5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task Details:</span></span>
