</span></span>
<span id="A4.I13.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I13.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I13.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I13.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Duration:</span> 4 days (3 nights), weekdays only</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I13.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I13.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I13.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I13.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Location:</span> Arches National Park</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I13.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I13.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I13.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I13.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Budget:</span> $6,000 maximum for flights and hotel</span>
</span></span>
