<span id="A4.I16.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I16.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Hotel has air conditioning</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I16.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I16.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.I16.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Hotel star rating <math id="A4.I16.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≥</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq</annotation></semantics></math> 3.0</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I16.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
